# Agent guide

Read .agents/skills/project/SKILL.md and the installed Maximus skill (node_modules/@arbol-ai/maximus/skills/maximus/SKILL.md). Code/docs are English. Use organizationId, strict schemas and namespaced scopes. Keep credentials and provider evidence in ignored .private/ (0700/0600). Add operations in resource modules; compose once in app.ts. Domain functions are shared with scripts. Tests own provider behavior, not framework JWT/protocol matrices. Run bun run verify. Never call live providers in CI. Configure audience, issuer, callers and deployment resources before release.

The root vite.config.ts owns the Vite+ toolchain. Use vp dev, vp build and vp check. Tests require an explicit human request; verify and deployment do not run them.
